SUMMARY:Pier & Beam August Happy Hour / 2026 Future Landmark Celebration
DTSTAMP:20260810T100234Z
DTSTART:20260827T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Each year\, the Future Landmark Award recognizes an outstanding
	 Houston building or place completed within the past decade — a project th
	at combines architectural excellence with a lasting contribution to its ne
	ighborhood and to the city. After weeks of nominations and voting by Pier 
	& Beam members\, we'll reveal this year's winner during a presentation at 
	6:45 p.m.\n\nhttps://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/8/27/pb-hap
	py-hour\n\nFrom Preservation Houston
URL:https://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/8/27/pb-happy-hour
